#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The link is gone, but has not yet been dropped by B<systemd-networkd>\\&."
msgstr ""
"Der Link ist verschwunden, wurde aber von B<systemd-networkd>(8) noch nicht "
"freigegeben\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
