"Slave-Netzwerkschnittstellen über ein Signal verfügen, aber mindestens "
"eine\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm opensuse-leap-16-0
msgid ""
"the link has carrier and is enslaved to bond or bridge master network "
